ecc-parameters-unimplemented-kdf-hash: no unimplemented hash in TPM2_ECC_Parameters

Classification: spec-deviation bug fix.

Specification (TPM 2.0 Part 2, "TPMI_ALG_HASH"): "TPMI_ALG_HASH is an
interface type of all the hash algorithms implemented on a specific TPM. ...
if the algorithm is not implemented in a specific TPM, that algorithm is not
included in the interface type", and Table "Definition of (ECC)
TPMS_ALGORITHM_DETAIL_ECC Structure": kdf "the default KDF and hash
algorithm recommended for use in secret sharing operations (may be
TPM_ALG_NULL)".

The curve table reports KDF1_SP800_56A with SHA-512 for NIST P-521 also when
SHA-512 is not implemented (ALG_SHA512 NO, the upstream profile), and with
SM3_256 for SM2 P-256 although SM3 is not implemented (ALG_SM3_256 NO), so
TPM2_ECC_Parameters returns a TPMI_ALG_HASH value the TPM does not accept.
Without the hash the recommended KDF of the curve is TPM_ALG_NULL.
diff --git a/TPMCmd/tpm/src/crypt/CryptEccData.c b/TPMCmd/tpm/src/crypt/CryptEccData.c
index dd212fc..f9a3c25 100644
--- a/TPMCmd/tpm/src/crypt/CryptEccData.c
+++ b/TPMCmd/tpm/src/crypt/CryptEccData.c
@@ -56,7 +56,13 @@ const TPM_ECC_CURVE_METADATA eccCurves[] = {
 #  if ECC_NIST_P521
     comma{TPM_ECC_NIST_P521,
           521,
+#    if ALG_SHA512
           {TPM_ALG_KDF1_SP800_56A, {{TPM_ALG_SHA512}}},
+#    else
+          // tpm-rs differential testing -- spec deviation fix (NOT determinism):
+          // the KDF hash is a TPMI_ALG_HASH, which has no unimplemented hash.
+          {TPM_ALG_NULL, {{TPM_ALG_NULL}}},
+#    endif
           {TPM_ALG_NULL, {{TPM_ALG_NULL}}},
           OID_ECC_NIST_P521 CURVE_NAME("NIST_P521")}
 #    undef comma
@@ -83,7 +89,13 @@ const TPM_ECC_CURVE_METADATA eccCurves[] = {
 #  if ECC_SM2_P256
     comma{TPM_ECC_SM2_P256,
           256,
+#    if ALG_SM3_256
           {TPM_ALG_KDF1_SP800_56A, {{TPM_ALG_SM3_256}}},
+#    else
+          // tpm-rs differential testing -- spec deviation fix (NOT determinism):
+          // the KDF hash is a TPMI_ALG_HASH, which has no unimplemented hash.
+          {TPM_ALG_NULL, {{TPM_ALG_NULL}}},
+#    endif
           {TPM_ALG_NULL, {{TPM_ALG_NULL}}},
           OID_ECC_SM2_P256 CURVE_NAME("SM2_P256")}
 #    undef comma
